<title>USA: Md. $141 mln housing deal yields 5.95 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Md. $141 mln housing deal yields 5.95 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $140.8 million Maryland Department of Housing and Community Development revenue bonds at a top yield of 5.95 percent in 2028.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
