<p>RE: $140,815,000*</p>
<p>MARYLAND DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING AND</p>
<p>COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p>HOUSING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996 A AND SERIES 1996 B</p>
<p>NO MORE ORDERS WILL BE ACCEPTED FOR THE 1997 MATURITY.</p>
