<p>THE BONDS MATURING ON JANUARY 1, 2016 ARE SUBJECT TO SPECIAL REDEMPTION FROM PREPAYMENTS OF A POOL OF SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE LOANS THAT HAVE A CURRENT OUTSTANDING PRINCIPAL BALANCE OF APPROXIMATELY $1.8 MILLION.</p>
<p>(PLEASE SEE THE &quot;SPECIAL REDEMPTION&quot; SECTION OF THE PRELIMINARY OFFICIAL STATEMENT BEGINNING ON PAGE 7.)  THE AVERAGE LIFE, ASSUMING 100% OF FHA PREPAYMENTS ON THE POOL OF SINGLE FAMILY LOANS IS 7.67 YEARS.</p>
